| `tests/integration/test_pip_cache_gate.py` | Derives every workflow and setup-python step and fails missing pip download caching, cache dependency paths that differ from existing files the pip install reads, conditional or absent installs, and zero setup steps. | `make test` | — | Reads workflow YAML and pip commands; it does not run the download cache. Not pipeline order or triggers: `tests/integration/test_ci_pipeline_gate.py` judges those. Not the Python version a setup step installs: `tests/integration/test_toolchain_gate.py` judges that. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
